"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>石丸クンの死体は台車で運ばれた…
#. 多分、これは間違いない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The dolly was used to move Taka's body, that much I'm\n"
"sure of.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも…例の不審者が、台車を押す事は
#. 可能だったのかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...would the person inside the suit have been able\n"
"to push the dolly?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>取っ手のない台車を押すには、
#. 腰を屈めた体勢にならなきゃいけない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The dolly doesn't have any handles, so to push it,\n"
"you'd have to be able to bend over...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、例の不審者が、
#. そんな体勢になれたのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But would anyone wearing that suit have been able to\n"
"actually stoop down like that?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
